# Memory Bank: kawaii_pdf

## Project Overview
- **Name**: kawaii_pdf
- **Type**: Flutter application (multi-platform) - PDF Manipulation App
- **Description**: kawaii pdf — Herramientas PDF con estilo kawaii 🌸
- **Version**: 1.1.1+4
- **Publish**: Private (`publish_to: 'none'`)

