## Architecture
Feature-First organization (fully implemented):
```
lib/
├── main.dart                          # App entry point (KawaiiPdfApp)
├── core/
│   ├── pdf_service.dart               # Core PDF operations (754 lines)
│   ├── office_templates.dart          # Office XML templates (200 lines)
│   └── theme.dart                     # Kawaii V2 theme (221 lines)
└── features/
    ├── home_screen.dart               # Main menu with 10 tool cards (V2 bubbles)
    ├── create_pdf_screen.dart         # Create PDF + URL/file/PPTX import + font options
    ├── merge_pdf_screen.dart          # Merge multiple PDFs (pick, reorder, merge)
    ├── split_pdf_screen.dart          # Split PDF (all pages, range, from page)
    ├── unlock_pdf_screen.dart         # Remove password from encrypted PDF
    ├── edit_pdf_screen.dart           # 3 modes: watermark, protect, modify text
    ├── convert_pdf_screen.dart        # Convert PDF to Word/Excel/PowerPoint/TXT
    ├── scan_pdf_screen.dart           # NEW: Scan document with camera → PDF
    ├── files_screen.dart              # NEW: File manager (filter, sort, share, delete)
    └── pdf_reader_screen.dart         # Full-screen PDF viewer
```

## Key Implementation Details

### PDF Engine: syncfusion_flutter_pdf
- **Merge**: `createTemplate()` + `drawPdfTemplate()` per-page copy
- **Split**: `splitPdfAllPages`, `splitPdfFromPage`, `splitPdfRange`
- **Security**: `PdfSecurity(algorithm, ownerPassword, userPassword)` for encrypt; open with password + copy pages for unlock
- **Watermark**: Rotated semi-transparent text via `PdfPageLayer()` + `graphics.drawString()`
- **Text extraction**: `PdfTextExtractor.extractText()` / `extractTextLines()`
- **Text modification**: Whitens out original text with white rectangles, draws new text on first page
- **Create**: configurable font family, size, bold, italic
- **Office Import**: `extractTextFromDocx()`, `extractTextFromXlsx()`, `extractTextFromPptx()` — parsea XML interno y extrae texto plano
- **Office Export**: `exportPdfToDocx()`, `exportPdfToXlsx()`, `exportPdfToPptx()`, `exportPdfToTxt()` — genera ZIP Office Open XML mínimo
- **Scan**: `createPdfFromImage()` — convierte imagen (cámara/galería) a PDF con auto-escalado
- **File Manager**: `getAppDirectory()`, `listAppFiles()`, `deleteAppFile()` — gestión unificada en `kawaii_pdf/`

### UI Framework: flutter/material (Material 3)
- Uses standard `import 'package:flutter/material.dart'`
- `useMaterial3: true` enabled
- Custom `AppTheme` class with full kawaii color palette

### Kawaii Theme System V2 (`core/theme.dart`)
- **Neutrals**: cream (#FDF9EE - warmer), blush (#FFEFF3), white (#FFFFFF - floating cards)
- **Pink scale**: pink50 → pink700
- **Bubble containers (V2)**: bubblePink, bubbleBlue, bubbleYellow, bubbleCoral, bubbleLavender, bubbleMint + dark variants
- **Accents**: lavender, peach, coral, mint
- **Text**: textPrimary (#4A2C3A), textSecondary (#8A6B78), textMuted (#B8A0A9)
- **Gradients**: gradHero, gradButton, gradCard, gradDreamy
- **Shadows V2**: kawaiiShadow (blur 24), kawaiiShadowLight (blur 12), bubbleGlow(color) for icon glow, softShadow for cards
- **Component theming**: AppBar (pink bg), Cards (white, 24px radius, soft shadow), Buttons (pill-shaped), Inputs (white, pink border, 16px radius)
- **V2 Icon Bubbles**: Iconos van dentro de círculos con fondo pastel + glow shadow del mismo color

### File Picker API v13
- `FilePicker.pickFile()` (single), `FilePicker.pickFiles()` (multiple)
- `FileType.custom` with `allowedExtensions: ['pdf']`

### Share API v13
- `SharePlus.instance.share(ShareParams(files: [XFile(path)], title: '...'))`

### State Management
- `StatefulWidget` + `setState()` throughout — no external libs needed


